				<br><br><div class="largetext">This statement is filed by: (i) Point72 Asset Management, L.P. ("Point72 Asset Management") with respect to the ordinary shares, par value NIS 15.00 per share (the "Shares"), of Tower Semiconductor Ltd. held by (and underlying options held by) Point72 Associates, LLC, an investment fund it manages ("Point72 Associates"), and another investment fund it manages (together with Point72 Associates, the "Point72 Funds"); (ii) Point72 Capital Advisors, Inc. ("Point72 Capital Advisors Inc.") with respect to the Shares held by (and underlying options held by) the Point72 Funds; and (iii) Steven A. Cohen ("Mr. Cohen") with respect to the Shares beneficially owned by Point72 Asset Management and Point72 Capital Advisors Inc.

